                                <li><strong>Band Gap Engineering:</strong> Electrons excited from valence to conduction band</li>
                                <li><strong>Photon Emission:</strong> De-excitation produces photons of specific energy/wavelength</li>
                                <li><strong>Quantum Confinement:</strong> Size-dependent optical properties</li>
                                <li><strong>Photoluminescent Efficiency:</strong> Maximized through proper coating materials</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

